        "color": 7,
        "height": 688,
        "content": "## Validate booking request\n\nThis middle-lower routing cluster checks whether the request is intended to book an appointment and sends an unknown-tool response when it does not match the expected booking action."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c3822c6a-7574-4db1-86d6-461bb7f33bc1",
